{"When iterating over multiple destinationCalendar entries that do not have a credentialId, events are created for all matching credentials but the destination.externalId is not forwarded, causing events to be created on the wrong calendar (e.g., default/primary) when a specific calendar externalId was chosen for that integration": 0.938412070274353, "The fallback logic for selectedCalendar in updateEvent/deleteEvent searches by comparing cal.externalId to externalCalendarId even when externalCalendarId is falsy, which can result in undefined being passed as the calendar id instead of a safe default like primary, leading to failed update/delete calls": 0.878496527671814, "In the updateAllCalendarEvents catch block, an error message is built but never logged, making production debugging significantly harder when calendar sync fails": 0.7903375625610352}